+- `evidence/21-stage4-regeneration-diff.txt` and
+  `evidence/22-stage4-hash-seed-replays.txt`: replay-order concern; and
+- `evidence/23-stage4-replay-target-stability.txt`: stable obligations and
+  target across replays.
+
+VERDICT: CONCERNS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
